{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"220","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Little Elephant and Array"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Little Elephant loves playing with arrays. He has array "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":", consisting of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" positive integers, indexed from 1 to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":". Let's denote the number with index "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" as "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Additionally the Little Elephant has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" queries to the array, each query is characterised by a pair of integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"lj"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"rj"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ lj ≤ rj ≤ n)"},{"kind":"text","text":". For each query "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"lj, rj"},{"kind":"text","text":" the Little Elephant has to count, how many numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" exist, such that number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" occurs exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" times among numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"alj, alj + 1, ..., arj"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help the Little Elephant to count the answers to all queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n, m ≤ 105)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the size of array "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and the number of queries to it. The next line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" space-separated positive integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"..."},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"an"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ ai ≤ 109)"},{"kind":"text","text":". Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain descriptions of queries, one per line. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of these lines contains the description of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th query as two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"lj"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"rj"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ lj ≤ rj ≤ n)"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers — the answers to the queries. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line should contain the answer to the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7 2\n3 1 2 2 3 3 7\n1 7\n3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"220B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/220/problem/B"}